  "instructions": [
    "1. Cut the tofu into small cubes and marinate in zesty salad dressing for at least 30 minutes.",
    "2. Preheat a grill or grill pan to medium-high heat.",
    "3. Grill the tofu until golden brown and crispy on both sides.",
    "4. In a large bowl, combine mixed greens, red bell pepper, cucumber, cherry tomatoes, red onion, and chopped cilantro.",
